From a453985945a5afe798354dd7b6889d4304de28bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reixo <125610085+Reixo0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:58:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 103/162] usb: typec: mux: wcd939x-usbss: fix the MG2_MISC
 register address

MG2_MISC sits at 0x2b, after MG2_EN (0x28) and MG2_BIAS (0x29), as
MG1_MISC (0x27) follows MG1_EN and MG1_BIAS. 0x30 is another register, so
probe set a bit there instead of the MG2 OVP dynamic boost.
---
 drivers/usb/typec/mux/wcd939x-usbss.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/typec/mux/wcd939x-usbss.c b/drivers/usb/typec/mux/wcd939x-usbss.c
index 53bcd9eddb81..322c185a54dc 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/typec/mux/wcd939x-usbss.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/typec/mux/wcd939x-usbss.c
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@
 
 #define WCD_USBSS_MG2_BIAS_PCOMP_DYN_BST_EN				BIT(3)
 
-#define WCD_USBSS_MG2_MISC			0x30
+#define WCD_USBSS_MG2_MISC			0x2b
 
 #define WCD_USBSS_MG2_MISC_PCOMP_2X_DYN_BST_ON_EN			BIT(5)
 
-- 
2.56.0

